{"2388420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Steam Punks", "steam_appid": 2388420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388420/extras/c02eb9d9ac475d6e2580a79f30065cda.poster.avif?t=1769551889\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388420/extras/c02eb9d9ac475d6e2580a79f30065cda.webm?t=1769551889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388420/extras/c02eb9d9ac475d6e2580a79f30065cda.mp4?t=1769551889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Steam Punks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Punks is a lore rich 3D action platformer with some metroidvania exploration elements!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of Dunns Calhan, one of Mayor Spurs elite enforcers, as he takes on the notorious Bowler Gang and tries to save Steamopolis from total destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Game Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Tons of Big Bosses + many mini bosses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Discover learn lore about the ancient realm </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Unlockable items and power ups  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Find Alchemy Shell Recipes and Learn to craft Powerful bullets for Dunns' Alchemy Gun <br>* Unlock secret areas and levels by exploring  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* And much more! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The First Megamanvinia Type Game</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >as you unlock items you can return to levels to reach new areas and secrets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_parag